<title>USA: Pitts &amp; Spitts completes Har-Whit buy.</title>
<headline>Pitts &amp; Spitts completes Har-Whit buy.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Outdoor products manufacturer Pitts &amp; Spitts of Texas Inc said on Thursday it completed the acquisitions of Har-Whit Inc and Pitts &amp; Spitts Inc for a total of $10.6 million in stock and cash.</p>
<p>Pitts said both companies were based in Houston and manufactured and distributed barbecue cooker and smoker pits, accessories and spices.</p>
<p>Pitts said the acquisitions were part of an outdoor products industry consolidation.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
